	"title": "Mini Asthma Quality of Life Questionnaire (Mini AQLQ)",
	"description": "The Mini Asthma Quality of Life Questionnaire (Mini AQLQ) measures the functional problems (physical, emotional, social, occupational) that are most troublesome to adults with asthma",
	"purpose": "A brief 15-item questionnaire assessing the impact of asthma on quality of life. It covers domains such as symptoms, activity limitations, emotional function, and environmental stimuli. Scores range from 1 to 7, with higher scores indicating better quality of life.",
